WEBVTT

01:05:58.750 --> 01:06:00.143
over the last few years.

01:06:00.167 --> 01:06:02.351
And at first I'm like,
"Wait, are you hedging

01:06:02.375 --> 01:06:04.309
in case your marriage isn't going well?

01:06:04.333 --> 01:06:06.601
You have another spouse?
What is this about?"

01:06:06.625 --> 01:06:10.476
So given that you've study relationships
and you work on relationships,

01:06:10.500 --> 01:06:12.268
what in the world is a work spouse,

01:06:12.292 --> 01:06:14.643
and do you think we should
have one as a preview?

01:06:14.667 --> 01:06:18.018
I think the answer is a very clear "no,"
but I want to hear your take.

01:06:18.042 --> 01:06:19.018
(Laughter)

01:06:19.042 --> 01:06:22.684
EP: The same way that when people say,
"Our company's a family,"

01:06:22.708 --> 01:06:24.434
I'm like, "Seriously?"

01:06:24.458 --> 01:06:26.351
You know, a family is a family.

01:06:26.375 --> 01:06:29.309
And I can tell you, family companies
are different from this,

01:06:29.333 --> 01:06:30.601
this is not the same.